    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess... i just don't want to be part of the panic. everyone else is running, screaming, trying to find a way out that doesn't exist. it's so loud and messy. do you think there's a way to actually control how it happens? like, to take the power back so it's not just something that happens to you?",
